===Etymology===
{{rfe|lang=en}}
[[Image:Beached coconut.JPG|thumb|200px|Beached '''coconut'''.]]
[[Image:Coconut.png|thumb|200px|[[Ivory Coast]]ian '''coconut'''.]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[fruit]] of the [[coconut palm]] (not a true nut), ''[[Cocos]] [[nucifera]]'', having a [[fibrous]] [[husk]] surrounding a large [[seed]].
# The hard-shelled [[seed]] of this fruit, having white flesh and a [[fluid]]-filled central [[cavity]].
# The [[edible]] white flesh of this fruit.
# The [[coconut palm]].
# {{pejorative}} A [[Hispanic]] or dark-skinned person who acts “white” ([[Caucasian]]), [[allude|alluding]] to the fact that a coconut is brown on the outside and white on the inside. Compare {{term|banana||East Asian who acts white|lang=en}}.
# {{context|South Africa|pejorative}} A [[black]] person who thinks "white" (European). Compare {{term|banana||East Asian who acts white|lang=en}}.
# {{New Zealand|pejorative}} A [[Pacific]] [[islander]].

